Excluded from the end-to-end run.

This example declares two organization-wide singletons, the custom property
definition and the organization ruleset, so two concurrent runs would fight
over the same objects. It also names a placeholder bypass actor
(actor_id = 12345) that does not exist in any real organization.

Making it runnable needs per-run names for both singletons and the real
installation id of the identity that runs the test. Until then the example is
documentation, validated by `tofu validate` and tflint like every other scope.
